-18.html\">18</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/31-21.html\">21</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/31-25.html\">25</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/31-27.html\">27</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/31-32.html\">32</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/31-34.html\">34</a></div></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s31a1\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}